<section class="section " id="options"><div class="container"><div class="pk-head"><h2>Choose your option</h2><p>Early bird until 31 March 2027. All prices in Singapore dollars.</p></div><div class="pk-opts"><div class="pk-opt" id="option-1"><span class="pk-n">Option 1</span><h3>Refresher</h3><p>Participation in the 3 modules at a special refresher price.</p><div class="pk-prices"><div><span>Early bird</span><b>S$2,200</b></div><div><span>Regular</span><b>S$2,900</b></div></div><a class="btn btn-navy btn-sm" href="#register" data-pick="1">Choose option 1</a></div><div class="pk-opt" id="option-2"><span class="pk-n">Option 2</span><h3>Supervised Refresher</h3><p>3 modules + 50% supervisions (no personal sessions).</p><div class="pk-prices"><div><span>Early bird</span><b>S$2,990</b></div><div><span>Regular</span><b>S$3,600</b></div></div><a class="btn btn-navy btn-sm" href="#register" data-pick="2">Choose option 2</a></div><div class="pk-opt" id="option-3"><span class="pk-n">Option 3</span><h3>Boosted Refresher</h3><p>3 modules + the 3 bonus programmes (value S$1,290).</p><div class="pk-prices"><div><span>Early bird</span><b>S$3,200</b></div><div><span>Regular</span><b>S$3,900</b></div></div><a class="btn btn-navy btn-sm" href="#register" data-pick="3">Choose option 3</a></div><div class="pk-opt" id="option-4"><span class="pk-n">Option 4</span><h3>Boosted Supervised Refresher</h3><p>3 modules + 50% supervisions (no personal sessions) + the 3 bonus programmes.</p><div class="pk-prices"><div><span>Early bird</span><b>S$3,990</b></div><div><span>Regular</span><b>S$4,600</b></div></div><a class="btn btn-navy btn-sm" href="#register" data-pick="4">Choose option 4</a></div></div><div class="pk-extra"><h3>What “50% supervisions” means</h3><p>Module 2: 1 online group and 1 online individual supervision. Module 3: 1 online individual and 1 online group supervision. The supervised options include no personal sessions.</p></div><div class="pk-extra"><h3>Bonus programmes (Options